  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall not be occupied until the XX cycle parking spaces within the buildings and XX cycle spaces outside the buildings have been fully implemented.  Thereafter, the cycle parking facilities shall be permanently retained for the duration of the development.\r\n\r\nMinor amendments may be agreed in writing from time to time by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><p>- DRAWING XXX REV XX DATED XX<br>- USE [SHIFT]+[ENTER] FOR REGULAR LINE SPACING<br>- USE [ENTER] FOR LARGER LINE SPACING</p><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245);&quot;&gt;Notwithstanding the details submitted with the application, prior to above ground works, full details of refuse storage shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority. Prior to occupation, the approved details shall be fully implemented. Thereafter, the refuse storage shall be permanently retained&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>"
